{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#card-zh","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session 是一款面向 DSH 桌面端和 Web 端的会话协作插件。它通过注册五个工具，让一个顶层会话发现并联系同一配置中的其他顶层会话。用户可发送消息和文件、读取完整对话记录、按关键词搜索历史，并等待对方完成后查看回复。适合多个独立 DSH 会话协同处理任务、复用已有讨论或核对工作结果。需要 DSH 0.2.x，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-70","lib/tools.js:99-159","lib/tools.js:163-175","lib/tools.js:260-305","lib/tools.js:308-361","lib/tools.js:363-424","lib/transport.js:28-74","lib/transcript.js:203-255"]}
{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#card-en","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cross-session is a session collaboration plugin for DSH desktop and web. It registers five tools that let one top-level session discover and contact other top-level sessions in the same profile. Agents can send messages and files, read conversation transcripts, search history by literal terms, and wait for peers to finish before reviewing replies. It suits workflows that coordinate independent DSH sessions or reuse prior discussions. Requires DSH 0.2.x; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-70","lib/tools.js:99-159","lib/tools.js:163-175","lib/tools.js:260-305","lib/tools.js:308-361","lib/tools.js:363-424","lib/transport.js:28-74","lib/transcript.js:203-255"]}
