{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#feature-1","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session 的功能「跨会话消息与文件」：让一个会话向一个或多个目标会话发送消息和附件；支持排队后续处理或引导正在运行的会话。 通过对应的 cross_session 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:163-225"]}
{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#feature-2","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session 的功能「会话历史读取」：读取目标会话的持久对话记录，可按序号增量读取，并选择是否包含工具调用与结果。 通过对应的 cross_session 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:260-305"]}
{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#feature-3","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session 的功能「对话关键词搜索」：按字面关键词搜索另一会话的历史消息，并返回匹配片段以便继续读取上下文。 通过对应的 cross_session 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:308-361"]}
{"unit_id":"zhyunran__dsh-cross-session#feature-4","repo":"zhyunran/dsh-cross-session","commit":"cdf07b5021c8b08a53a7ad06a920a6b65dd0d554","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session 的功能「等待会话完成」：等待一个或多个会话空闲，并从其记录中返回最近的最终 assistant 消息。 通过对应的 cross_session 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:363-424"]}
